:"2026-03-30T15:34:26+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166845036,"discussion_id":"0aef2a190106387b8df9131069061d96e25acbb1","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复FlashAttention梯度计算后处理模块中，当处理TND布局数据且遍历至最后一个批次时，计算当前序列长度（curS）会访问越界内存的问题。原逻辑在批次索引（bIdx）等于批次总数（b）时，会读取数组`seqS`的无效索引`seqS[b]`，存在导致未定义行为或程序崩溃的安全风险。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`FlashAttentionScoreGradPost`类的`NZVecClc`方法及其特化版本中，针对`LAYOUT == TND`的情况增加了边界检查。修改后，仅当`bIdx < b`时按原逻辑计算`curS`；当`bIdx >= b`时，将`curS`设置为0。此改动通过防御性编程避免了数组越界访问，提升了代码健壮性。","created_at":"2026-03-30T15:31:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T15:31:25+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166855382,"discussion_id":"9b02e99d05e20c54f0bdad18515dd88ab6dcb062","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-30T16:21:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T16:21:50+08:00","user":{"id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","login":"hz36amy_00","object_id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","name":"yf_zhou","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/fe/f7239cf91485e812c31979edd3584327eaab4edbd7f232c495d1e234e28e9df3.png?time=1757139706596","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hz36amy_00"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166855572,"discussion_id":"c1da19653f1cc28e818616f30262c2900b5c5378","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=72403103cdfe489e8ffc0df2219c497b&projectName=CANN'>72403103cdfe489e8ffc0df2219c497